{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07051","headline":"酬张夏雪夜赴州访别途中苦寒作 · 刘长卿","name":"酬张夏雪夜赴州访别途中苦寒作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扁舟乘兴客，不惮苦寒行。\n晚暮相依分，江潮欲别情。\n水声冰下咽，砂路雪中平。\n旧劒锋鋩尽，应嫌赠脱轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07051.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07051","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}